---

---

<div class="sm">
  <p class="sm__statement" data-scroll-text lang="en">
    Every child deserves a family, a school and a safe place to grow up, and every community can
    give them one when it is supported to.
  </p>
  <p class="sm__statement" data-scroll-text lang="km">ការអប់រំគឺជាមូលដ្ឋានគ្រឹះនៃអនាគតរបស់កុមារ</p>

  <div class="sm__band" data-scrub>
    <div class="sm__band-art"></div>
  </div>

  <p class="sm__figure" data-scrub data-scrub-start="top 90%" data-scrub-end="bottom 40%">
    <span class="sm__figure-n"></span> families supported
  </p>

  <div class="sm__steps" data-scroll-steps>
    <div class="sm__panel" aria-hidden="true">
      <div data-panel="0">Step one: reach the family</div>
      <div data-panel="1">Step two: keep the child in school</div>
      <div data-panel="2">Step three: the community takes over</div>
    </div>
    <div class="sm__list">
      <section data-step>
        <h3 class="sk-h3">Reach the family</h3><p>A social worker visits and listens first.</p>
      </section>
      <section data-step>
        <h3 class="sk-h3">Keep the child in school</h3><p>
          School costs and learning support are covered.
        </p>
      </section>
      <section data-step>
        <h3 class="sk-h3">The community takes over</h3><p>
          Local groups carry the work on without us.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .sm {
    display: grid;
    gap: 3rem;
  }
  .sm__statement {
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 38ch;
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 1rem + 2vw, 2.5rem);
    line-height: 1.25;
  }
  .sm__band {
    height: 18rem;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: 1rem;
    background: var(--color-blue-50);
  }
  .sm__band-art {
    height: 140%;
    background: linear-gradient(160deg, var(--color-blue-700), var(--color-blue-50));
    transform: translateY(calc(var(--p, 1) * -28%));
  }
  .sm__figure {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
  }
  .sm__figure-n {
    counter-reset: n calc(var(--p, 1) * 1250);
    font-size: 3rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .sm__figure-n::before {
    content: counter(n);
  }
  .sm__steps {
    display: grid;
    gap: 2rem;
  }
  .sm__list section {
    min-height: 60vh;
  }
  .sm__panel {
    position: sticky;
    top: calc(var(--header-h) + 1rem);
    align-self: start;
    padding: 1.25rem;
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    background: var(--color-blue-50);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .sm__panel [data-panel] {
    display: none;
  }
  .sm__panel [data-panel='0'] {
    display: block;
  }
  .sm__steps[data-active-step] [data-panel] {
    display: none;
  }
  .sm__steps[data-active-step='0'] [data-panel='0'],
  .sm__steps[data-active-step='1'] [data-panel='1'],
  .sm__steps[data-active-step='2'] [data-panel='2'] {
    display: block;
  }
  @media (width >= 64rem) {
    .sm__steps {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
